# =============================================================================
# 9. Frontend Auth (no API � JWT reuse, 1d expiry unchanged) � manual verify
# =============================================================================
# Auto logout 5m: client/src/hooks/useInactivityLogout.js used in AdminDashboard.jsx:18.
#  Manual: login via 1.3 ? visit /admin-dashboard ? idle 5m (or temporarily 10s) ? token+admin cleared, localStorage inactive_logout=1, redirect to /login ? login page shows "You have been logged out due to inactivity." (AdminLogin.jsx:13).
#  Backend still enforces 401: try without token ? should get 401.
# Already logged in: while logged in as any role ? visit /login ? expect "You are already logged in. Please logout first." + Logout button (AdminLogin.jsx:13 early return), no form. After Logout ? form renders.
# Protected route: without token ? visit /admin-dashboard ? ProtectedRoute.jsx redirects to /login; with doctor token ? visit /admin-dashboard ? redirect to /doctor-login (wrong role).

### 9.1 Smoke 401 without token � should be 401 No token provided (authMiddleware.js:8)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/stats
# No Authorization header � expect 401

### 9.2 Smoke 401 with bad token � should be 401 Invalid or expired token (authMiddleware.js:31)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer bad.token.here

